# solace/solace-pubsub-connector-ibmmq:2.13.0
#
# This one capture describes every connector release from 2.10.0 onwards
# (libs.EmbeddedListMinVersion): the classpath does not move between releases,
# and 2.14.1's capture is byte-for-byte identical to this file. Recapture from
# a newer image and diff before adding a second list -- an identical capture
# means this file already covers that release and only the floor's evidence
# changed.
#
# Regenerate with:
#   docker run --rm --entrypoint sh solace/solace-pubsub-connector-ibmmq:2.13.0 -c 'find / -name "*.jar" -not -path "/proc/*" 2>/dev/null | xargs -n1 basename | sort'
